# Labs

Every lab page stacks a CareerGenie `WorkspacePanel` explainer (what / why / what you are seeing) above an interactive panel with a live trace (chunks, scores, or graph nodes).

- Query only the bundled corpus in `data/corpus/`.
- If Ollama is down, show how to start it — do not silently call a cloud API.
- Keep matching `docs/labs/<lab>.md` updated in the same change.
